   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h3>Those who perform measurement tasks on tools while the CNC machine is running can produce more efficiently. </h3>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c614",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>Presetting &amp; Measuring fundamentally changes the way you manufacture. You’ll significantly reduce setup times, minimize scrap, extend tool life, and lower production costs. There are many good reasons to choose ZOLLER’s presetting and measuring machines. </strong></p> <p>For machining operations, exact tool measurement data is essential for ensuring reliable processes and first-class results. ZOLLER’s presetting and measuring machines provide this data with micrometer-level accuracy. ZOLLER goes one step further. The devices are so simple to use that every measurement—regardless of the operator—always yields precise measured values. </p> <p>Presetting &amp; Measuring with ZOLLER means shifting responsibility for the result—from the operator to the measuring machines. Given the shortage of skilled workers and high cost pressures in manufacturing, having tools measured by a ZOLLER device is the best decision you can make. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/presetting-measuring\">Display Products</a> <a href=\"/ca/profitability-calculator\">Determine Savings Potential</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c616",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
   ],
   "ftype": "container-2cols",
   "id": "c615",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "none",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Setup time decreases by more than 40% </h2>",
   "body": "<p>If you measure just five tools on a ZOLLER presetting and measuring machine before the tools are mounted on the machine, you can reduce setup time by more than 40%.</p> <p>Setup during active production time with ZOLLER opens the door to significant cost savings. Depending on the number of tool changes required, cost savings per shift and CNC machine can amount to 15,000 euros per year. Depending on the presetting and measuring machine and its configuration, your investment can pay for itself in just a few months. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/solutions/presetting-measuring\">Determine your savings potential now</a></p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c621",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> More Data, Better Workpiece Quality </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The measuring technology of a CNC machine typically enters only the tool length. This is not sufficient to fully exploit a machine’s high precision potential.</p> <p class=\"large-text\">With ZOLLER, you receive detailed geometric data that enables CNC machines to produce with even greater exactness. Achieve the highest quality in your manufacturing. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/d/csm_presetting_01_59fab0dfc1.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1220,
     "h": 1250
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c620",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Improved Productivity </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Machine downtime is costly and unnecessary. When tools are pre-set before being loaded onto the machine, you can start the next order sooner. Maximize your productivity now with a ZOLLER presetting and measuring machine.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/5/csm_presetting_02_f4a2e05503.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1220,
     "h": 1250
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c619",
   "bg": "white",
   "space": {
    "before": "none",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2 class=\"headline-decor\"> Use Tool Life Maximally </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">With a ZOLLER presetting and measuring machine, you’ll know even before a production run begins whether a tool is still intact or not. By presetting and measuring, you can regularly check the cutting edge quality. You’ll prevent unproductive tool changes and use the tool life completely. Presetting &amp; Measuring with ZOLLER increases the cost-effectiveness of your production. </p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/a/csm_presetting_03_f94d19dc0f.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1220,
     "h": 1250
    }
   ],
